I see that the AF_IB patch set is still listed in patchworks as 'New', which I guess is good in that it hasn't been lost.  Any chance on getting any feedback on the patches soon?

We have some user space areas that are ready to take advantage of AF_IB support when it's ready.  I can spin an entirely new set of patches and retest everything if needed, but I was hoping to delay further testing until after an initial review.  There are no outstanding issues that I'm aware of.  (The latest patches are available from my rdma-dev.git tree.)

I realize that there are a large number of patches, but I did try to break things up to keep reviewing it as simple as I could.

Thanks,
